        "subtitleJa": "記録するトラフィックを条件で絞り込み、ログ量とノイズを削減できます",
        "en": "Generally Available: Network Watcher VNet flow logs filtering"
      },
      "meta": {
        "publishedJst": "2026-10-27",
        "availability": [{ "rawRing": "General Availability", "year": 2026, "month": "October" }],
        "status": "Launched",
        "products": ["Network Watcher"],
        "categories": ["networking", "ops-governance"],
        "importance": "notable"
      },
      "audience": {
        "who": { "text": "Network Watcher の VNet フロー ログを使っている**ネットワーク／セキュリティ運用担当者**", "origin": "mrc", "assertion": "inference", "verification": "source-only" },
        "change": { "text": "必要なフローだけ記録でき、ストレージコストと分析時のノイズを減らせる", "origin": "mrc", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "source-only" },
        "changeNature": "benefit"
      },
      "action": {
        "required": "optional",
        "summary": { "text": "ログ量が多く困っていれば検討", "origin": "editorial", "assertion": "recommendation", "verification": "unverified" }
      },
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": "how-it-works", "heading": "仕組み", "availability": "present", "priority": "core",
          "items": [
            { "text": "IP・ポート・プロトコル・暗号化状態・方向で記録対象を指定", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/network-watcher/vnet-flow-logs-filtering", "locator": "サポートされているフィールド", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z" }] },
            { "text": "フロー状態（開始 / 継続 / 終了 / 拒否）でも絞り込める", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/network-watcher/vnet-flow-logs-filtering", "locator": "RecordTypes に基づくフィルター処理", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z" }] },
            { "text": "= / != と && / || で条件を組み合わせ可能", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/network-watcher/vnet-flow-logs-filtering", "locator": "サポートされているオペランド", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z" }] }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "how-to-start", "heading": "設定の流れ", "availability": "present", "priority": "core",
          "items": [
            { "text": "Azure portal または PowerShell でフィルター条件を設定できる", "origin": "mrc", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "source-only" },
            { "text": "PowerShell: New-AzNetworkWatcherFlowLog の -EnabledFilteringCriteria で作成", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/network-watcher/vnet-flow-logs-filtering", "locator": "フィルター処理を有効にする", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z" }] },
            { "text": "既存のログは Set-AzNetworkWatcherFlowLog で再作成せず更新可能", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/network-watcher/vnet-flow-logs-filtering", "locator": "既存のフィルター処理を更新する", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z" }] }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "prerequisites-limits", "heading": "前提・制限", "availability": "present", "priority": "detail",
          "items": [
            { "text": "フィルター文字列は最大 1,000 文字。角かっこは未対応、AND が OR より先に評価", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/network-watcher/vnet-flow-logs-filtering", "locator": "サポートされている形式", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z" }] },
            { "text": "ストレージ アカウントは VNet と同じリージョンで Standard が必須", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/network-watcher/vnet-flow-logs-overview", "locator": "ストレージ アカウント", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z" }] }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "related-features", "heading": "似た機能との違い", "availability": "present", "priority": "detail",
          "items": [
            { "text": "NSG フロー ログは NSG 単位、VNet フロー ログは仮想ネットワーク単位で記録", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/network-watcher/vnet-flow-logs-overview", "locator": "VNet フロー ログと NSG フロー ログの比較", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z" }] },
            { "text": "重複記録や追加コストを避けるため、同じワークロードでは NSG フロー ログを先に無効化", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/network-watcher/vnet-flow-logs-overview", "locator": "VNet フロー ログと NSG フロー ログの比較", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z" }] }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "use-case", "heading": "使いどころ・注意", "availability": "present", "priority": "detail",
          "items": [
            { "text": "拒否トラフィックのみ記録するなど、監視・調査の目的に絞って運用する", "origin": "editorial", "assertion": "recommendation", "verification": "unverified" },
            { "text": "監視・トラブルシューティング・セキュリティ・コンプライアンスの用途で必要な通信に集中できる", "origin": "mrc", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "source-only" }
          ]
        }
